  (text "Host board for the sparsity-aware convolution chip (Tiny Tapeout, SkyWater 130 nm).\nKeeps the Tiny Tapeout demo board v3 RP2350B pin map, so its firmware and the host/ test kit run unchanged,\nand adds an INA228 power monitor on the chip core supply. Demo board design (c) 2025 Pat Deegan, Apache 2.0."
